# CM/LM research consolidation

**Canonical snapshot:18 September2026.** Start here, not in a historical report. This repository consolidates source definitions, proofs, corrections and actual checks, then assigns a minimum coherent publication portfolio: **existing Paper B plus two prospective mathematical papers**. Novelty is not inferred from CM terminology or from a search returning no match.

