## Claims and formal mathematics

The [Markdown registry](claims/CLAIM_REGISTRY.md), [CSV](claims/claim_registry.csv) and [JSON](claims/claim_registry.json) track71 stable IDs, models, assumptions, proof/finite status, source locations, corrections, prior art and one primary home. [Conflict ledger](claims/CONFLICT_LEDGER.csv) and [evidence ledger](claims/EVIDENCE_LEDGER.csv) retain history rather than overwriting it.

Read the [theorem index](math/THEOREM_INDEX.md), [compiled18-page theorem bank](math/THEOREM_BANK.pdf), and [editable theorem bank](math/THEOREM_BANK.tex). Shared files: [definitions](math/definitions.tex), [notation](math/notation.tex), [operational contracts](math/model_contracts.tex), [proof dependencies](math/proof_dependency_graph.md) and [build instructions](math/BUILD.md). The bank includes analytic proofs, imported facts and marked finite-only records;71 claims are not71 new theorems.

## What was computed, and what was not

[Computational ledger](computation/COMPUTATIONAL_LEDGER.md) and [experiment registry](computation/EXPERIMENT_REGISTRY.csv) describe102 named passing pytest tests, supplied-code reruns and a new independent checker. [Reproduction status](computation/REPRODUCTION_STATUS.md) distinguishes completed stages, interruptions and inherited files. [Benchmark status](computation/BENCHMARK_STATUS.md) reports the synthetic10,500-row corpus and generic equality; no new timing campaign was run. [Missing evidence](computation/MISSING_RAW_EVIDENCE.md) names outstanding data precisely.

Use the [portable runner](computation/reproduce.py), [requirements](computation/requirements.txt), [new exact checker](computation/independent/consolidation_checks.py), [results](computation/independent/independent_results.json), [dual-number certificates](computation/independent/dual_number_contextuality.json), [actual dense decoders](computation/independent/explicit_dense_decoders.json), and [oracle-contract checker](computation/independent/oracle_contract_check.py). The [delivered runner validation](computation/portable_validation/completed_run_manifest.json) completed 21 explicit stages. Exact stage logs are in [fresh_logs](computation/fresh_logs/); selected data in [fresh_data](computation/fresh_data/). Mere presence in the latter is not proof that every copied file was regenerated.

