[Annotated bibliography](literature/ANNOTATED_BIBLIOGRAPHY.md) records 31 sources and access limits. [Prior-art matrix](literature/PRIOR_ART_MATRIX.csv), [32-query search log](literature/SEARCH_LOG.csv) and [novelty gaps](literature/NOVELTY_GAPS.md) separate established antecedents from candidate results. Use [references.bib](literature/references.bib) for manuscripts and [reference metadata](literature/REFERENCE_RECORDS.json) for auditing. A [static bibliography](literature/references_static.tex), generated by [this script](literature/build_static_bibliography.py), supports pdflatex-only builds without inventing citations.

